ont-size: 21px\">4.招标文件的获取</span></strong></p><p style=\"margin-right:0;margin-left:17px;text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%\"><span style=\";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px\">4.1凡有意参加投标者，请于</span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px\">202</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px\">6</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px\">-</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px\">7</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px\">-</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px\">3 12</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px\">:00至202</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px\">6</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px\">-</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px\">7</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px\">-</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px\">10&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px\">23:59</span></span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px\">(北京</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);letter-spacing:-0;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">时间，下同</span>),登录</span><span style=\";font-family:宋体;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\"><span style=\"f